      "height": 252,
      "text": "### Preserve DNS, Kerberos names and time across a pivot\n\n**When:** An IP connection works while hostname/Kerberos access fails\n\n**Still required:** Reachable correct resolver/KDC path, matching target SPN/hostname, realm configuration and acceptable time\n\n**Preserve DNS, Kerberos names and time across a pivot — on this canvas**",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:start",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 22695,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## Route a selected internal subnet through Ligolo-ng\n\nSeveral protocols/subnets require a route-style interface through an agent",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:discover",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 22655,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 228,
      "text": "### Discover\n\n```text\nip route\nip link\n./proxy -h\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:interpret",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 22635,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### What the output establishes\n\nA selected internal network and proxy-incompatible client suggest a route-style agent, subject to its own transport behavior.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:validate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 22881,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Missing prerequisite\n\nVerify compatible proxy/agent, local privileges, carrier, selected route/interface, DNS and any separate reverse listener.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:enabled",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": 22585,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "### Condition confirmed\n\nThe routed application test works on the selected subnet: choose the agent route.\n\n**Verify:** Verify route/interface ownership, destination application and each necessary reverse listener.\n\n[[notes/pivoting.md#ligolo-route|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:ruledout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": 22926,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Condition disproved here\n\nA conflicting/unmodifiable route prevents this design: reject it or select an approved alternate subnet mapping.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:unknown",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": 23147,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Evidence inconclusive\n\nAgent connection alone does not prove interface, route or destination reachability.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:action",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3130,
      "y": 22585,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 228,
      "text": "### Procedure entry — full sequence in the note\n\n```bash\n./proxy -selfcert -laddr 0.0.0.0:LIGOLO_PORT\n```\n\n[[notes/pivoting.md#ligolo-route|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:ligolo-route:next-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3130,
